   "body": "Closes #378\n\nAn agent approval at commit A counts at head B when every commit after A merges the base branch (second parent already on the base) and the files the PR changes are untouched between A and B. Otherwise a new review is needed. CI at B is still checked as before.\n\nKnown limit: the check does not verify the merge author, and a clean merge that changes a PR file (even without a conflict) still gets a review (conservative).\n\nChecks: test_gate_github, test_gate, state-machine all pass.\n\n\ud83e\udd16 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nProduced by Air Automations. Name: [Slop factory] implement-mid / Run: https://air.jetbrains.cloud/org/05cf1a7f-6ab5-713b-abd3-29d0c8a05e2d/automations/e539f449-950c-4af9-a550-11ca8d65ed19?run=c778f552-635b-40a3-a794-a8b55136c288",
